- op: discuss  # b803
  at: '2026-04-16T13:15:14Z'  # b803
  by: agent  # b803
  actor: jgstern_agent  # b803
  clock: 4  # b803
  nonce: b803  # b803
  message: "Fixed in PR #3065 (merged to dev at feb1e21f7). Root cause: the Solidity edge extractor keyed using_libraries by the call site's enclosing contract, so a file-level 'using X for Y;' (which Solidity binds to the source unit, stored under '') was invisible to calls inside contracts in the same file. Fix: when dispatching a member call inside a contract, union the contract-scoped library set with the file-level ('') set before probing for {Library}.{method}. Cross-file resolution works via global_symbols. Regression test covers the cross-file case (library in Memory.sol, caller in Reader.sol, file-level using in Reader.sol)."  # b803
